=============================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: REGEX(.*)
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "id": "urn:V1",
  "speed": 30,
  "type": "Vehicle"
}



07. Delete urn:V1 on CB
=======================
HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json



08. Delete urn:V1 on CP1
========================
HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json



09. Delete urn:V1 on CP2
========================
HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json



10. Create entity urn:V1 on CP2 with speed=300 (no observedAt)
===============================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Location: urn:V1
Link: REGEX(.*)
Content-Length: 0



11. Create entity urn:V1 on CB with speed=100 (no observedAt)
==============================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Location: urn:V1
Link: REGEX(.*)
Content-Length: 0



